{"3001640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Bucketlist Tourist", "steam_appid": 3001640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Pack your camera, grab some friends, and get ready for a party game that escalates faster than you can say “Cheese!”<br><br><strong>The Bucketlist Tourist</strong> is a multiplayer photo adventure where everyone tries to snap the perfect shot.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.poster.avif?t=1777578394\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.webm?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/16f633ca1ddf144ccd66cfeea02bdae6.mp4?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br>With your remote trigger and only a few tries, you’ll explore vibrant, lively locations inspired by real-world destinations. Tasks range from creative to chaotic and sometimes just wonderfully absurd.<br><br>After each round, your photos are judged. Whoever captures the best shots and has the most exciting vacation is crowned the ultimate Bucketlist Champion.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.poster.avif?t=1777578394\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.webm?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/d32b274556746c8c800b6a6286a9685e.mp4?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Couch co-op done right:</strong> Play together on the couch and enjoy wonderfully chaotic fun.<br></li><li><strong>Photos, photos, photos:</strong> Shoot away — whether it’s a perfect shot or a gloriously failed experiment.<br></li><li><strong>Colorful destinations:</strong> Discover vibrant places with unique characters inspired by famous landmarks.<br></li><li><strong>Bucketlist challenges:</strong> Take on creative, wacky, and sometimes surprisingly tricky tasks.<br></li><li><strong>Active Ragdoll Physics:</strong> Creates unpredictable, hilarious poses and makes every photo unique.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.poster.avif?t=1777578394\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.webm?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001640/extras/89c6252927593a23d3939f117feab1fc.mp4?t=1777578394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy to jump in:</strong> Simple controls make it accessible for everyone.<br></li><li><strong>Rewards for snapping:</strong> Good pictures earn in-game currency to unlock outfits, accessories, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Play your way:</strong> Compete against each other or work together — mood dependent.<br></li><li><strong>Your tourist, your style:</strong> Customize your character’s outfit to reflect your personality.<br></li><li><strong>Always something new:</strong> Free updates bring fresh locati